---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import HeroCarousel from "../components/HeroCarousel.astro";
import titanicBelfast from "../assets/images/titanic_belfast.jpg";
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION } from "../data/site";
---

<Base
  bodyClass="rates"
  description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}
  ogImage="titanic_belfast.jpg"
  path="/rates/"
  title="BT1 Apartments - Our Rates"
>
  <HeroCarousel
    id="rates"
    slides={[{ image: titanicBelfast, alt: "Titanic Belfast" }]}
  />

  <article class="page">
    <header class="header">
      <div class="container">
        <h1 class="title">Our Rates</h1>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <p>
          Selected apartments can be booked for residential and short term stays.
          Long term and short term rates are negotiable. Long term rates are
          negotiable depending on your budget, and we will guarantee to beat any
          competitor rate in a similar location and facility.
        </p>
        <p>
          All facilities, products and services are included in our daily rate
          so no hidden charges, providing a home from home experience.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Complementary WiFi (Secure)</li>
          <li>Flat-screen televisions</li>
          <li>Fully equipped kitchen with top-of-the-range appliances</li>
          <li>Fridge / freezer</li>
          <li>Washing machine / dryer</li>
          <li>Dishwashers*</li>
          <li>Kettle / Toaster</li>
          <li>Microwave</li>
          <li>Soft furnishing includes sofas and dining table x 4 chairs</li>
          <li>Open plan living area with flat screen Freeview TV</li>
          <li>Complimentary toiletries</li>
          <li>Weekly apartment servicing (new linen / towels / toiletries)</li>
          <li>Egyptian cotton bed linen and fluffy towels</li>
          <li>Private balcony</li>
          <li>Central heating / Gas / Carbon monoxide alarm</li>
          <li>Main entrance security pin / swipe card access</li>
          <li>24 Hour support call service and flexible check-in times</li>
          <li>Parking available on request</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Some of the finer detail...</h2>
        <div class="sub-section">
          <h3>Competitive pricing</h3>
          <p>
            Our rates fluctuate, so we are always trying to stay as competitive
            as possible depending on how busy the city is so we're more than
            happy to tailor a quote to suit your party size, the duration of
            your stay and your travel arrangements.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="sub-section">
          <h3>Cancellation, Deposits and Refunds</h3>
          <p>
            When you send an enquiry we will reply with the booking payment and
            cancellation terms and conditions. Depending on the length of stay
            and lead in time of the booking this will determine how flexible
            terms will be.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="sub-section">
          <h3>Security Deposit</h3>
          <p>
            If you do decide to book and confirm we will normally request a 10%
            deposit and arrange a payment plan for the remainder that suits both
            parties. If you are staying long term again the same principal.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="sub-section">
          <h3>Long Term Contracts</h3>
          <p>
            We prefer that a lease or contract is signed if you know you will be
            in Belfast for a period longer than 6 months. If the nature of your
            work does not allow you to plan that far ahead a rolling month
            agreement can be arranged as well.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="sub-section">
          <h3>Short Term Stays</h3>
          <p>No contract is required, just your signature on arrival. Just like
          a hotel.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="sub-section">
          <h3>Beat the quote or pricing around</h3>
          <p>
            Remember, if you find a better quote we strive to match if a similar
            facility and location; so feel free to give us a call and discuss a
            package or we're happy to organise a site visit, have a coffee at
            any of our locations before you book.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>
